    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "490c5e2bfc39070d42248f282d56270f0b5d9fad498d3e0a3c3802f9584e8402",
      "text": "Day 6 · Transfer to the airport and flight to Salvador da Bahia; on arrival, our driver takes you to your hotel.\n\nSalvador, the African soul of Brazil, is where the descendants of enslaved Africans have preserved their cultural roots more than anywhere else in the Americas: hypnotic drumbeats, graceful movement, fragrant spices and an irresistible energy, celebrated in festivals such as its famous Carnival. Even on an ordinary day you may come across a capoeira circle, taste acarajé, bean and shrimp fritters fried in dendê oil, or discover the Afro-Brazilian traditions of Candomblé.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1P3ewH7_BgelQIugsOUGNzkVJbuAvfvxO",
        "documentSha256": "a207e3e7a588d09678d507ed1e71cb7e7a5b4c5f370f2f1567b029da38a19e4c",
